w-up regarding cirrhosis. She reported no new symptoms and felt stable. Her blood pressure was 120/78, and she weighed 176 pounds. Her cirrhosis continues to be well controlled.\n\nOn November 01, 2021, Ms. Galvan visited for a routine lab review. She reported feeling well and had no new symptoms. Her blood pressure was 120/86, and she weighed 187 pounds. Her cirrhosis was stable, and all lab results were within normal limits.\n\nMs. Galvan's social history reveals that she consumes approximately two alcoholic drinks per week. She has not reported any significant issues related to her alcoh"
